"this directory, it will show two subdirectories, `A1` and `A2`.  The "
"directory tree looks like this:"
msgstr "将 `A` 设为根文件系统。使用 man:ls[1] 查看此目录的内容时，会显示两个子目录 `A1` 和 `A2`。目录树如下所示："

